<title>USA: Equity Residential says sells shares.</title>
<headline>Equity Residential says sells shares.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equity Residential Properties Trust said it sold $75 million in registered common shares of beneficial interest to Stichting Pensioenfonds ABP, a Dutch pension fund.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used for acquisition of more multifamily properties, said the real estate investment trust.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
